<messaging:emailTemplate subject="Follow Up - Items Needed for your Pre-Approval" recipientType="Lead">
<messaging:htmlEmailBody >
<html>
<head>
<style type="text/css">
.myButton {
    display: inline-block;
    vertical-align: middle;
    padding: 12px 24px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: #0082cb;
    font: normal normal bold 20px arial;
    color: #ffffff !important;
    text-decoration: none;
}
.myButton:hover,
.myButton:focus {
    background: #142850;
    cursor: pointer;
}
</style>
</head>
<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">
<span class="container"></span>
<p>Hi {{BORROWER_FIRST_NAME}},<br />
<br />
Circling back on the items below. Once these are in, I can keep everything moving on your pre-approval, so if you are able to get them over in the next day or two that would be a big help.</p>
{{REQUESTED_DOCUMENT_LIST}}
<br />
<p>Anything you have already uploaded is still saved, so there is nothing to send twice. Here is your secure portal again:</p>
<div><a class="myButton" href="{{LEAD_PORTAL_LINK}}">Upload Files</a></div>
<br />
<p>As soon as I have them, I will review everything and follow up with your next steps.</p>
<span class="end-container"></span>
<p>{{SENDER_SIGNATURE}}</p>
</body>
</html>
</messaging:htmlEmailBody>
</messaging:emailTemplate>
